**Layout**
Left-aligned throughout (not centered) — reads like a station ID card / liner notes rather than a marketing template. Hero pairs a two-line headline with a hand-built amber waveform (the one bold visual moment). Pricing tiers sit in a three-column grid styled like channel strips: square corners, no shadows, a colored top rule per tier standing in for a fader marking instead of a decorative card shadow.

