**Assumption:** The brief only specifies "family-run Sicilian bakery, open since 1962" — no name, town, or family details were given. I invented all of that to ground the design: **Panificio Lo Cascio**, in **Bagheria**, a town near Palermo, founded by **Turi & Concetta Lo Cascio**, now run by their granddaughter **Marta** and grandson **Dario**. Swap these for the real details before shipping.

## Design plan

**Color** (majolica ceramics + Sicilian ingredients, not the cream/terracotta default)
- `#F2E9D6` plaster — background, like a whitewashed shop wall
- `#2C2118` ink — text, dark wood counter
- `#1F5C86` azure — majolica tile blue, primary accent
- `#E2A63B` saffron — lemon/citrus, secondary accent
- `#5C6B3A` olive — pistachio, tertiary accent
- `#7A2E27` wine — used only on the medallion ring and one underline, kept scarce

**Type**
- Display: **Libre Caslon Display** — headlines, section titles, the medallion numerals. Warm, moderate contrast, not the thin/thick "AI serif" look.
- Body: **PT Serif** — paragraphs, nav, labels, all in one family so nothing reads as bolted-on meta text.

**Layout**
```
[tile strip: azure/saffron diamonds]
  The oven has not gone            (1962)
  cold since 1962.                 medallion
  We are the Lo Cascio family...
[tile strip]

Nonno Turi's oven          |  "quote from Rosa"
(prose, ~68ch)             |  — pull quote aside

1962 ------ 1994 ------ Today        (real 3-gen sequence)
Turi&Conc.  Rosa&Pino    Dario&Marta

[chalkboard panel: ink bg, plaster text]
  What comes out of the oven
  Pane di casa  — dense country loaf...
  Sfincione     — Sunday only...
  ...

Come by
Where: ...        Hours: ...
```
Left-aligned throughout, no centered hero, no rounded-card grid.

**Principles**
- Every structural device maps to a real bakery object: tile strip = ceramic trim, medallion = shop plaque, dark panel = literal chalkboard menu, timeline = the actual three generations (a real sequence, so numbering is earned).
- One motion moment: the tile strip wipes in on load; nothing else animates. Respects `prefers-reduced-motion`.
- Sentence case everywhere — no ALL-CAPS eyebrows, no middle-dot meta strings, no arrow-suffixed links.

*Self-check: an early draft had a hero line reading "Panificio Lo Cascio · Bagheria · dal 1962" — a middle-dot meta string, one of the listed tells. Rewrote it as a plain sentence in the lede instead.*

