I'm designing this as **Spindle**, an indie podcast hosting service, and grounding the visual identity in analog tape/broadcast culture — tape decks, reels, cue stickers — rather than generic SaaS chrome. Audience: solo hosts and small crews choosing a plan and starting to upload; the page's job is to make that choice fast and concrete. Three tiers: Tape Deck (free), Reel-to-Reel (recommended), Studio Master.

